# {{.Name}}

English | [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)

A desktop application built with [Keel](https://keel.dyike.com).

```sh
keel run              # Run
keel build            # Package for the current platform into dist/
keel build -target windows
keel doctor           # Check the build environment
```

- Edit the UI in `app.go`; window setup lives in `main.go`.
- Configure the application name, ID, version, and icon in `keel.json`. Replace `appicon.png` with a square, full-bleed 1024×1024 image without rounded corners. Packaging applies the macOS, Windows, and Linux icon shapes. Use `keel icon` to preview all three.
